# PWA: the service worker is hand-written and committed (see public/sw.js).
# next-pwa and its generated workbox-* output were removed; those lines used to
# ignore public/sw.js, which would have silently dropped the worker from deploys.

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# OS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Tool scratch directory that is not part of this project. `~/` is a full
# external checkout (gstack) that landed in the repo root and includes its own
# .git. It is untracked, but it pollutes `git status` and — because it contains
# thousands of files — makes `prettier --check .` report syntax errors from
# unrelated shell scripts. See docs/reasonix/plans/travelapp-hardening-plan.md.
~/